  - parking-assistance
  - finite-state-machine
abstract: >
  An original, educational STM32 firmware project implementing a
  four-corner ultrasonic parking assistance system for the NUCLEO-G071RB,
  featuring a finite state machine, sensor filtering, a distance-based
  decision engine, servo-driven scanning, LCD status display, progressive
  buzzer warnings, and UART telemetry.
